{"ref":"passive:bracer","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Bracer is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked by getting ",{"t":"King Bible","r":"weapon:king-bible"}," to Level 4."]},{"k":"p","c":["Bracer increases ",{"t":"Projectile Speed","r":"powerup:speed"}," by 10% per level."]},{"k":"p","c":["Bracer is required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Knife","r":"weapon:knife"}," into ",{"t":"Thousand Edge","r":"weapon:thousand-edge"},". It is also required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Flash Arrow","r":"weapon:flash-arrow"}," into ",{"t":"Millionaire","r":"weapon:millionaire"},", in which Bracer must be fully leveled."]},{"k":"p","c":["Bracer can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Gallo Tower","r":"stage:gallo-tower"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", and ",{"t":"Lake Foscari","r":"stage:lake-foscari"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["SPEED"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+10%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Gallo Tower","r":"stage:gallo-tower"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Lake Foscari","r":"stage:lake-foscari"},"."]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Bracer has 5 levels. At max level, Bracer provides +50% ",{"t":"Projectile Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["\"Increases projectiles speed by 10%.\""]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Base speed up by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Base speed up by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":